SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\n**IMPORTA
 NT NOTE:** In order to prevent event cancellation I’m going to need at l
 east one member who I’ve previously met and played with to confirm meeti
 ng at 8 AM via public comment. Not everyone is going to want to start this
  early but no one is going to want to hold a court by themselves for a hal
 f an hour or more. So when lacking this confirmation I’m going to cancel
  the event within an hour of the official start time. Either way\, please 
 use the comments to coordinate better start times for yourselves with othe
 rs. We can’t please everyone with an exact start time but if we all comm
 unicate here then we can at least try. So please let us know your planned 
 arrival time in the comments and be sure to monitor the event and discussi
 on and be ready to adapt accordingly.\n\n**VOTES:** Since this is still a 
 “test” time slot\, I welcome votes from proven members for changing th
 e official start time. If we’ve already met then private message me your
  vote for the exact time and I’ll start an official record. Thanks for y
 our patience and understanding as we work this all out.\n\n**ABOUT THE GRO
 UP:** We are typically beginner to intermediate levels playing in a friend
 ly\, sociable\, and supportive environment while not being shy to a little
  friendly competition. We may rally freely in the beginning to warm up and
  then move on to some quick-rotation matches between 5-7 points. No formal
  teams here so everyone should be ready to both play with and against ever
 yone else who shows up.\n\n**EQUIPMENT:** Please be sure to bring your own
  racquet and water\, as we don’t provide those. Also\, I always have som
 e balls for at least one court\, but feel free to bring your own as well i
 n case we need to branch out over more than one court.\n\n**DISCLAIMER:** 
 Courts are subject to availability and weather. If you make serious plans 
 to attend then please be prepared to cancel or adjust our location as need
 ed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree to be fully responsible for your 
 own health and safety. Each person is responsible to take a break for rest
  and water at their own discretion.
