SUMMARY:V for Volleyball at Watchung Reservation & BBQ
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then we'll k
 eep score. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive where you must
  serve to score! Games will be to 25 or 15 or 10 if we have more people pl
 aying. No kicking\, no using your head.\nThere's no fee to play\, maybe br
 ing a ball. We'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nWe have our own Vo
 lleyball NET\, poles\, & ropes!\nThere's a fire pit nearby so we will cook
  & have a barbecue.\nIf you have fun and would like to play with us at oth
 er locations\, join us!\n[V for Volleyball New Jersey | Facebook](https://
 www.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)\nhttps://fb.me/e/7lvHvo9Aq\nhttp
 s://maps.app.goo.gl/i8ZJ5VZycEzs8v3XA
